@startuml
autonumber
actor Client
participant "Filter (JwtAuthFilter)" as Filter
participant "Controller" as Ctrl
participant "Service" as Svc
participant "Repository" as Repo
database "Database" as DB

Client -> Filter: GET /api/v1/admin/dashboard (Headers: Authorization: Bearer <AT>)
Filter -> Svc: jwtGenerator.isValidToken(AT)
Svc -> Repo: tokenRepos.findByTokenStr(AT)
Repo -> DB: SELECT * FROM tokens WHERE token_str = AT
DB --> Repo: Token record hợp lệ
Repo --> Svc: Token entity
Svc --> Filter: return true

Filter -> Repo: userRepos.findByUsername(username)
Repo -> DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = username
DB --> Repo: User data (role = STUDENT)
Repo --> Filter: User entity
Filter -> Filter: Set SecurityContextHolder

Filter -> Ctrl: Forward Request
Ctrl -> Ctrl: Spring Security authorization check (Yêu cầu: ADMIN)
note over Ctrl: Kiểm tra vai trò: STUDENT != ADMIN
Ctrl --> Client: 403 Forbidden (Access Denied)
@enduml
